Rl1e l1e 0 1e12
* Measurement with RMS from @vlad
XU4 L1e L1rms1 RMS1a fc={fc} b0=1 b1=3
Een L1e 0 VALUE={V(L1)*v(enable2)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
* 120Hz (115-125Hz) LC Filter for RMS https://rf-tools.com/lc-filter/
L1 L1rms1 L1rms 156.6m
